  "description": "webpx is the command-line front end for Darnelix.Webp, a pure-C#, dependency-free WebP codec: encode, decode, inspect (info), edit containers (mux/demux), and build or extract animations — all on the same managed codec, with no native code and zero runtime dependencies.",
