  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 — Darnelix.Webp.Cli installs webpx, the command-line tool for the Darnelix.Webp codec, which it carries: no native code, zero runtime dependencies. Commands: encode (image to WebP, lossy or lossless, with alpha, a target size or PSNR), decode (WebP to image, with pixel layout, scale, crop and flip), info (header features), mux (set or strip ICC, EXIF and XMP; the animation loop count and background colour), demux (list chunks and frames; extract metadata), and anim build / anim extract (frames to animated WebP and back). Reads and writes PAM, PPM, PGM, BMP and headerless raw pixels. Exit code 0 on success, 1 on a data or I/O error, 2 on a usage error.",
  "title": "webpx — Darnelix.Webp command-line tool",
